--- !u!114 &114301351572752089
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1430260866319120}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 82d8a94e9c20ecfbd56f229eb2edccda, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  textSound: snd_txtsans
  fontName: sans
  greetMessage: '* heya.^10\n* how can i help\n  ya?'
  idleMessage: '* not really doing\n  anything else.'
  exitMessage: wink`* see ya later.
  buyGreet: whaddya \nwant?
  buySuccess: wink`thanks.
  buyReject: neutral`ya don't \nwant that?
  buyNoMoney: side`you don't \nhave the \nmoney.
  buyNoSpace: neutral`you're \ncarrying \ntoo much \nstuff.
  item1ID: 33
  item1price: 75
  item1ShortDesc: Changes AT\nwith HP
  item2ID: 34
  item2price: 80
  item2ShortDesc: Icicle that\nnever melts!
  item3ID: 35
  item3price: 30
  item3ShortDesc: Eat it twice!
  item4ID: 37
  item4price: 45
  item4ShortDesc: Q.C.'s recipe
  sellPrompt:
  - "* Sorry,^05 we don't buy things\n  here."
  talkGreet: wink`yeah, i \ncan talk.
  topic1: About yourself
  topic1lines:
  - neutral`* i think i've seen enough\n  of your adventures to\n  figure out that your name\n  is kris.
  - wink`* but we can get better\n  acquainted when i'm NOT\n  covering for someone.
  topic2: What're you doing
  topic2lines:
  - closed`* why am i working a random\n  odd job?
  - side`* i'm covering for the shop\n  owner,^05 q.c.
  - rolleye`* i owe her for,^05 uhh...^10\n  papyrus getting into some\n  trouble.
  - wink`* it's fine,^05 though.\n* pay's pretty good.
  - closed`* ... but i get the odd feeling\n  that i'm forgetting to do\n  something.
  - closed`* something something\n  calibrating my puzzles...
  - wink`* eh,^05 whatever.
  topic3: Directions
  topic3lines:
  - side`* funnily enough,^05 we're at the\n  end of the forest.
  - neutral`* past town is where we enter\n  the marsh.
  - closed`* it's called "waterfall."
  - wink`* prolly cuz of all the\n  waterfalls.
  - neutral`* i hear the royal guard head\n  is doing some searching around\n  there.
  - wink`* keep an eye out for her.
  topic4: Doppelganger
  topic4lines:
  - closed`* looks like you guys took\n  care of evil me.
  - neutral`* went about as well as it\n  could've.
  - closed`* cuz i dunno if the...^10\n  other option would be pretty.
  - closed`* or even satisfy the justice\n  itch.
  - wink`* but who can really say?^10\n* what's been done, ^10\n  's been done.
  sellGreet: watcha \ngot?
  sellSuccess: wink`thanks for \nthat.
  sellReject: side`not that?
  sellDeny: closed`eh, no \nthanks.
